<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - S&amp;P lowers National Foods rating.</title>
<headline>RTRS - S&amp;P lowers National Foods rating.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Monday it had cut the long term rating for National Foods Ltd to BBB from BBB plus.</p>
<p>&quot;The downgrade reflects the company's weakened profitability, and heightened business risk profile in increasingly competitive markets,&quot; S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
